Usage: python3 gen_pack.py <input.xml> <prelude.h>; it prints the C header to
stdout. The first argument is a genxml file, the second a header whose text is
copied to the top of the output. The prefix "agx" is fixed inside the script,
so struct names come out as AGX_<NAME>. The prelude Mesa pairs with it
(agx_pack_header.h) includes Mesa's own util headers; tools/defs/genxml_prelude.h
is a small stand-in that defines the same helpers.
